WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
08:00 — Family trip. Family trip overview on the phone — London to Lahore, Umrah plus visits — five people, one dashboard.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
10:00 — Kids on iPad. iPad checklist with the kids pointing at passport rows; scramble becomes a game with a finish line.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
19:00 — Laptop pack. Laptop full document pack before packing night; nothing lives only in a parent’s head.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
20:00 — Flights. Flights on the laptop for the whole party; seats and times visible without five separate screenshots.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
21:00 — Phone. Phone day-of view at the door. Five passports. One checklist. Calm enough to joke.

